<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Argentina raised in portfolio.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Argentina raised in portfolio.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for Argentine shares to overweight from neutral in a model portfolio of Latin American stocks.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
